      Readonly "0"
      Name "SEQ_Daily_Load"
      Description "Nightly warehouse load"
      NextID "17"
      Container "V0"
      FullDescription =+=+=+=
Waits for the ready flag, loads products, orders and customers, builds the
sales summary, archives, then extracts the accounts of each region.
=+=+=+=
